      "writtenOn": "2024-01-12T11:12:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we make this an API, we won\u0027t be able to change it.\n\nIt may be better to keep the constant hidden, and just mention it in the javadoc of setTtlSeconds ? Then if we want to relax the check, we can just update the javadoc (possibly using a compat flag, but if it\u0027s just relaxing the range that may not be necessary)",
